{"unit_id":"wacly__dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage#readme-1","repo":"wacly/dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage","commit":"f8086e1cb41f0c7f5cd8804fae2138092599b4f0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage README · dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage：给 DeepSeek Harness（`dsh`）的动态插件补上「持久化」能力：把当前会话里的动态插件导出到磁盘保存，之后按需选择性地加载重放回来，重启不丢失。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage"}
{"unit_id":"wacly__dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage#readme-2","repo":"wacly/dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage","commit":"f8086e1cb41f0c7f5cd8804fae2138092599b4f0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage README · 功能：安装后，模型（AI）可以调用三个工具：\n\n- `export_dynamic_plugins`：把当前会话的动态插件逐个导出保存到磁盘\n- `list_dynamic_plugins`：列出磁盘上已保存的插件\n- `load_dynamic_plugins`：按 `names`（包名）选择性加载指定插件\n\n同时，Web 界面提供两个入口：\n\n- **设置 → 动态插件**：管理磁盘仓库里的包——列表、导入、改名、删除、沉淀。\n- **会话顶部「插件」tab**：展示当前会话已加载插件的运行时状态，支持全部导出、单插件导出、沉淀、重新加载、卸载。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"wacly__dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage#readme-3","repo":"wacly/dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage","commit":"f8086e1cb41f0c7f5cd8804fae2138092599b4f0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage README · 使用示例：```\n导出：「把当前会话的动态插件导出一下」\n选择加载：「先列出可加载的插件」→「加载 xxx 和 yyy 这两个」\n运行时管理：在会话顶部的「插件」tab 里卸载/重新加载已加载的插件\n沉淀：「把这个插件沉淀成标准的 DeepSeek 插件」","source":"extracted","section":"使用示例"}
