{"unit_id":"wacly__dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage#readme-7","repo":"wacly/dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage","commit":"f8086e1cb41f0c7f5cd8804fae2138092599b4f0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dynamic-plugin-manage README · 3. 启动：pnpm dsh --profile demo web\n```\n\n打开 Web 界面后，进入「设置」→「动态插件」管理磁盘仓库；或进入任意会话，在顶部「插件」tab 查看并管理当前会话已加载的插件。","source":"extracted","section":"3. 启动"}
